' S-570 (2026-10-16): writing a field through a NULL class reference must stop with an error and must
' not touch any other object (the MIR interpreter used to overwrite the first object's field: `d.v` became 5).
CLASS Box
    PUBLIC
    DIM v AS I32
END CLASS
DIM d AS Box = NEW Box()
d.v = 9
DIM k AS Box
PRINT "before"
k.v = 5
PRINT d.v
